OL,3,ARain to return this week with chance of
OL,4,Athunderstorms and flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe weather is set to turn more
OL,7,Funsettled this week as rain returns
OL,8,Fwith a chance of thunderstorms and
OL,9,Flocalised flooding.
OL,11,FSome places could see a return to
OL,12,Fshowery conditions by Tuesday, but it
OL,13,Fis from Wednesday onwards that more
OL,14,Fwidespread and persistent rain will
OL,15,Farrive from the south.
OL,17,FThe wet weather will be welcome for
OL,18,Fparched regions of the UK, but a lot
OL,19,Fmore will be needed before drought
OL,20,Fconditions start to ease.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
