OL,3,ARain to return this week with chance of
OL,4,Athunderstorms and flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as the rain, temperatures will
OL,7,Falso be on the rise once more, as
OL,8,Fwarmer air moving in could push midweek
OL,9,Fhighs close to 27C (81F) in places.
